+### eMudhra (Tark, October 2026)
+
+Eight eMudhra intermediate CA keys were generated with too little randomness
+and can be computed from the public certificates (disclosed 17-20 October
+2026). Chrome blocked the six TLS ones by CRLSet and removed emSign ECC Root
+CA - G3 from the Chrome Root Store (v43). Tark receives no CRLSet updates, so
+their keys are blocked here; both certificates of each key (issued by emSign
+Root TLS CA - G3 and cross-signed under AAA Certificate Services) are listed.
